WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Demon Lord, Belphemon, Revived

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.550
The Demon Lord, Belphemon, Revived!

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:25.110
Masaru's hatred towards Tohma for betraying them caused his Burst Mode to run wild.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.030
ShineGreymon was swallowed up by that power,

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:31.060
and he was forced to return to a Digiegg.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:47.680
Meanwhile, Ikuto discovered that Kurata wished to revive Belphemon to rule the world.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.140
Kurata!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.140
Ikuto!

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.000
But the two were taken down by Tohma and MirageGaogamon.

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:01.850
Ikuto!!!

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.610
Where are you?!

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.520
Falcomon!

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:09.080
Did you find them?

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:09.710
No.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:10.960
There was no sign of them anywhere!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.400
I can't believe Tohma fought against Ikuto...

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:14.930
That bastard...

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.320
He won't get away with this bullshit.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.090
Why?

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.340
Why is this happening?

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikuto!

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:24.780
Falcomon!

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.400
Have you completed it?

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:37.740
Here's the Digimon controller you asked for.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.720
Now you can command Belphemon as you wish.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.930
Thank you, Tohma-kun.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:48.770
Now that you're helping me, the success of my plans is secured.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.630
The one who should be grateful here is me.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:55.320
After all, you are saving my younger sister's life.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.110
Please be assured.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:02:00.270
I will cure Relena-chan's illness without fail.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:04.240
I trust your word, of course.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:06.790
Now,

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:10.720
why don't we witness the Demon Lord's revival together with our own eyes?

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.930
Awaken, Belphemon!

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:22.360
The world will soon be kneeling before me!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.190
So, you're friends of my brother?

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.650
Yes, you could say that.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.710
But is this really a good idea?

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.550
My surgery is today.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.710
They've told me not to leave my room...

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:47.720
Oh, is that so?

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.370
Then I guess we should move faster.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.330
Oh dear.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:57.590
Oh?

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:58.760
This is...

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.100
There are so many Digimon!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.340
It can't be...

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.760
N-No, it's nothing.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.760
By "surgery," they meant...

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:12.730
fusing her with a Digimon!

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.570
That's enough, Yushima-san!

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:17.730
Brother!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.240
Relena, get away from that man.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.240
He's awake!

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.120
Where am I...?

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.220
You made us worry!

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.770
I'm amazed you're still alive after taking that attack!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.910
It wasn't a direct hit...

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.260
Ow...

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.260
Here.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.110
Thanks.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:41.920
Back then...

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.880
MirageGaogamon's claws...

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:49.340
missed my face by a hair's breadth.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:53.100
But I was still blown away by the shock wave.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.380
It doesn't make sense that his attack missed at that range...

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.680
Maybe Tohma...

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.920
Anyway, it's great to see you've survived.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.140
We've only just started our fight with Kurata.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.240
Get your strength back quickly, okay?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.140
Kurata!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.770
We have to stop him!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.660
Or Belphemon will be resurrected!

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.350
Belphemon?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.470
What's that?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.460
One of the legendary Seven Great Demon Lords.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:18.980
A long time ago,

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.110
they almost brought the Digital World to the verge of total destruction.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:24.520
That thing...

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.680
mustn't be reawakened...

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:34.910
Kurata is gonna use Belphemon to control both the human world and the Digital World!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.440
That's the worst of the worst...

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.400
That Kurata...

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.620
I've gotten totally fed up with him...

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.190
We've gotta do something quick...

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.070
Really...

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.910
I can't be too careful around you two.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.410
Brother...

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.940
Don't worry.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.920
I'll protect you.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.380
You don't need to worry about a thing, Relena.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:11.050
I thought you betrayed us because your sister was being held hostage.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.810
That's absurd.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.520
In fact, this was a profitable chance for me.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.070
Chance?

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.580
Professor Kurata will cure my sister's illness for me.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:27.750
In addition, I can utilize my genius intellect here to my heart's content.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:32.530
Frankly, I felt that my abilities at DATS were like casting pearls before swine.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.990
Did you know...

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:39.280
that the surgery is really to fuse your sister with a Digimon,

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.380
and turn her into a Digimon-human?!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.240
That's...!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.670
That's the only way to cure Relena's illness!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:47.470
You...

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.800
But this devilish conduct will surely not go unpunished...!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:54.750
If we don't do anything, only death will await her!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.120
It doesn't matter what methods we use!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.250
It's our duty as a family to cling to any opportunity that'll give her a chance at life!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.100
I don't care what form she'll end up turning into!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.270
As long as she gets to live...!

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.070
Are you okay with this?

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:07.690
Absolutely.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.460
It's a Digimon signal!

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.580
Now, Belphemon!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.550
Show them your power!

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.360
Unleash your Lampranthus!

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.120
Eternal Nightmare!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:50.150
Y-Yes, sir! We're currently taking counter-measures for this situation.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.270
Yes! Do not worry, sir!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:57.020
Where is Kurata-kun?! Why haven't we gotten through to him yet?!

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.540
Kurata-kun...!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.880
Governor Hashiba!

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:00.750
Kurata...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.310
It's been a long time, Governor.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:09.650
Have you seen the wondrous destructive power of my strongest weapon, Belphemon?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.610
What did you just say?

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.610
K-Kurata!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.100
You...

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.900
You're controlling that Digimon?

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.390
Is it that hard to believe?

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.370
But it's the truth!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.120
Just what are you after?!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.760
Such a straightforward question.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.500
Then let me answer you just as bluntly.

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:31.860
World domination!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:32.260
Wha-!

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:38.000
I am the savior who's protected the human world from the Digimon's assaults.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.970
This makes me the most suitable to be this world's king!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.600
Impossible...

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.890
Please notify the governments of every nation.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.200
They are to quickly renounce their sovereignty

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:53.070
and vow unconditional surrender to me, their ruler of the new world!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.370
The countries who oppose my demands

00:08:55.370 --> 00:09:00.030
will burn down in Belphemon's flames of judgment!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:07.040
And by that, I mean their lands, their civilization, and all of its living things!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.770
We're the only ones who can fight against Belphemon right now!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.890
We must do whatever it takes to stop him!

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:16.840
Yeah!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:20.810
We can't let Kurata get away with what he wants anymore!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:21.930
We'll fight, too!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.060
Masaru, you stay here on standby!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.130
Wait a minute...!

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:30.780
How would you be able to fight Belphemon without your partner?

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:31.650
Well...

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.320
We don't know when Agumon will hatch from his Digiegg.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.750
So stay with him!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.110
You can leave this to us!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.330
But...!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.250
This is a pain on my old bones...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.890
But Tohma...

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:56.920
Do you really plan to turn Relena into a Digimon-human?

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.840
Brother.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.040
When I get better,

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:07.230
I want to go racing with you and Gaomon.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.680
Okay.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:11.810
It's a promise.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.520
Let's go, everyone!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.500
Yeah!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.500
Yeah!

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.800
Digisoul Charge!

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.040
Overdrive!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.200
Lalamon, evolve!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.530
Rosemon!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.420
Digisoul...

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.930
Full Charge!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.340
Falcomon, evolve!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:40.940
Yatagaramon!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.700
PawnChessmon, Realize!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.700
PawnChessmon, Realize!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.700
Here they come.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.060
Let's join them!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.580
It's about time we showed off the strength of our Perfect Levels!

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.730
Digisoul...

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.730
Digisoul...

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.470
Full Charge!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.470
Full Charge!

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.470
PawnChessmon, evolve!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.510
RookChessmon!

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:11.140
RookChessmon

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:11.140
Perfect Level

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.340
RookChessmon.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.920
A Perfect Level Digimon that boasts of its iron-wall defense.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.140
Its special attack is Rook Gatling!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.010
PawnChessmon, evolve!

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.100
BishopChessmon!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:22.820
BishopChessmon

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:22.820
Perfect Level

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.250
BishopChessmon.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.750
A Perfect Level Digimon that has perfect command of its offensive techniques.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.820
Its special attack is Bishop Laser!

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.970
A fine way to kill some time!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.250
Obliterate them, Belphemon!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.420
Careful, everyone!

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.430
We won't go down just from that!

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.400
Rook Gatling!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.850
Bishop Laser!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:01.570
Yatagaramon!

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.950
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.410
Roses Rapier!

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.240
My attack doesn't reach him!

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:18.610
The Digivices that Daimon Suguru made for you are absolutely worthless!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.960
You won't win when you depend on the Digisoul theories of a lowbrow scientist!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:32.740
RookChessmon!

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.670
BishopChessmon!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:37.670
Yatagaramon!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.070
Rosemon!

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.360
Digimon are controlled through power!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.820
I just proved that now!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.620
It's my victory!

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:52.750
Agumon...

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.300
When are you gonna wake up?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:14:00.460
It's true that I didn't consider your feelings back then...

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.930
All I could think about was beating up Tohma...

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.590
I apologize for that!

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:05.650
But y'know,

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:09.340
there are things that hurt more than a Digisoul of hatred.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.700
I'm hurting right now.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.150
Everyone is fighting desperately,

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.850
but I'm the only one who can't do anything!

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:19.650
You're feeling just like me, right?!

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:23.230
It hurts not being able to do anything even though your soul is fired up!

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.210
So, please,

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.600
fight with me!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:30.140
Hurry and come back, Agumon!

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.370
Is everyone okay?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:41.600
Yes.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.590
But we can't get close to him at this rate.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:48.340
This is the strength of a legendary Demon Lord...

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.600
Those are...

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.270
helicopters from the Ministry of Confidentiality!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.180
Target locked!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.770
ATTACK!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.150
Got him!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:28.880
What?!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.590
I see.

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:33.590
I'll take this to mean you refuse my demands.

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.480
Now, Gaomon!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:46.980
Yes, Master!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:53.570
Tohma!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.760
This surgery is canceled!

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.630
He stopped?

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.150
What in the world...?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.530
Looks like I made it just in time.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:10.130
Tohma-kun!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.050
Thank goodness. This is an emergency.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.950
The Digimon controller broke!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.500
There's a simple reason behind that.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:21.110
I placed a bomb inside it.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.550
What?!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.390
Belphemon won't be able to move anymore!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.280
Your ambitions end here!

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.820
T-Tohma...!!!

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.070
Just as I thought...

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.700
You were only pretending to betray us.

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:39.080
There was a bomb planted in Relena's necklace.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.720
The only time it could be taken off was during the surgery.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:47.670
That's why I had no choice but to earn his trust and turn the tables on him.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:52.870
I could hear the silent screams bursting from within my master's heart.

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:56.080
That's why I obeyed him, believing in this moment.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.680
What's the meaning of this, Tohma?!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.230
Father!

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:04.600
Nothing else but this surgery can save Relena's life!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.020
No.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.100
<i><b>I</b></i>  will cure her. {<--- onkei: If there's a way to make the "I" more pronounced in this line, please do. Using italics on "I" alone makes it look weird, don't you think? xD;; }{Splash: mmmmm I tried xD}

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:11.070
I won't give up.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.720
I will save Relena!

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:18.140
Hundreds of the best doctors and researchers in the world examined her illness,

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.310
but no one could find a cure.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.290
What makes you think you'll do any better?!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:25.330
I've been studying all this time just for that purpose!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:32.410
Yushima-san.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.390
I'm sorry, but please take care of Relena.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:35.730
Leave it to me.

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:36.830
Let's go, Gaomon!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:37.940
Yes, Master!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.630
Tohma will definitely find a cure.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:44.890
One that doesn't use these demonic methods.

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:47.320
Tohma Norstein!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.850
How dare you betray me!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.810
You...!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.320
But you are naïve, Tohma-kun.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:01.080
My ambitions won't crumble from this alone.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.560
Now that it's come to this,

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:08.010
I'll just have to turn into Belphemon's heart myself!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:34.630
What's that?

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.160
Gather your bearings!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.230
Retreat to a farther distance!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.920
A blackout?

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:05.810
What's going on?

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:20.280
Belphemon Rage Mode

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:20.280
Ultimate Level

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.830
Belphemon Rage Mode.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:15.160
The true form of the Ultimate Level Belphemon, after he has awakened from his long sleep.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:17.320
His special attack is Lampranthus.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.280
The chains wrapped around his body release black fire!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.310
I'll take no more prisoners!

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:26.240
Everything will burn to the ground!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.840
Isn't that voice... Kurata's...?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.210
What's going on?

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.770
He couldn't have fused with Belphemon, could he?

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:38.320
What was that?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.170
I don't believe this...

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:52.640
Damn it.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.880
I didn't think Kurata would use himself to fuse with it and evolve...

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.840
Time to stop him, Gaomon!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.020
Yes, Master!

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:02.020
{onkei: I really want to know how Tohma did his Charge in mid-air. xDD}

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.840
Digisoul Charge!

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:07.080
Overdrive!

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.130
Gaomon, evolve!

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:30.600
MirageGaogamon!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.940
TOHMA!!!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.830
{onkei: I also want to know how he can always FLIP in mid-air. DDD: Kanpeki choujin dakara ka, sou ka}{Splash: :DDD}

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.760
Now, let's defeat him!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.030
Our real enemy!

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:44.200
Yes, Master!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.470
Damn it!

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.280
What's happening to everyone?!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.560
I can't take much more of this!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.500
Let's go, Agumon!

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.890
Masaru-niichan!

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.010
Mom.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:56.920
Chika.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.580
Even if Agumon and I stay here, there's nothing we can do!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:04.690
Everyone is fighting for their lives,

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:07.380
but we're the only ones forced to stay on the sidelines!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:09.080
I can't deal with that!

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:12.420
I don't know what'll happen, but I'm going to where everyone else is!

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.850
I have to!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:16.350
Okay.

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:19.520
Go.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.120
Mom...

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.940
All right, Agumon! Let's fight together!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.910
We're heading there right now!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.120
Just wait,

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.190
you guys!

